{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/935831-the-kupala-chronicles-v-tm-d-tf-crossover","id":935831,"title":"The Kupala Chronicles (V:TM, D:TF Crossover)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-22T15:14:28-07:00","id":935831,"title":"The Kupala Chronicles (V:TM, D:TF Crossover)","content":"A crazy campaign idea I may or may not use in the future.<br /> <br /> <b>The Kupala Chronicles (V:TM, D:TF Crossover)</b><br /> <br /> My <b>Kupala is Saulot</b> theory is founded by the idea of the Souleaters being extensions of Kupala having infected the Tzimisce bloodline and Vicisstitude. In this universe, Kupala has been an Earthbound trapped with Geomancy for centuries (millenium?) but who has developed a special rapport with vampires as a whole due to the Tzimisce's connection with the land as well as Koldunic Sorcery.<br /> <br /> Kupala attempted to take over Tzimisce first and the rest of his childer, having an affect on their sanity by making them all more or less homicidal maniacs obsessed with shape-shifting (due to Kuapala being a Defiler in his previous existence). Basically, Kupala was sharing his torment with all of the Tzmisce and their desire to become angels/transcend the flesh is basically thier reflection of Kupala's song.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, Tzimsice is such a powerful mind that he was unable to completely be ejected from Kupala's mind and he eventually become a Gestalt of Tzimsice minds absorbed into the Cathedral of Flesh--making him every bit the equal of the godlike Elohim. Kupala was finally released at the end of the Transylvania Chronicles but did so by moving his soul into Tremere's body completely.<br /> <br /> This is actually something which has an affect on Kupala as demons who move into human bodies and gain human memories are affected by the experience. Kupala is the same way even though a vampire archmage isn't the same as, say, a Los Angeles call girl or a Baptist preacher who have more positive effects on Demon characters. Kupala as Tremere, however, has absorbed the memories leftover from the diablerie of Saulot as well as Tremere's own, allowing him to become LESS Tormented. Kupala sees now the ancient arcane magics of ascension, Golconda, and believes now that he can use a combination of magic as well as the way of the Salubri to ascend to godhood and assume the mantle of divinity which the Creator has abandoned.<br /> <br /> In a very real way, the vampire demon king has had a religious experience and has begun recruiting both demons as well as vampires into his service. He opposes the other Earthbound as they wish to unmake reality while Kupala believes he can now restore it to the way it should be. Indeed, he has started to believe this was the Creator's plan all along since he's inherited Tremere's monomania.<br /> <br /> Tremere, in Goratrix's body, wants none of this to happen and thinks Kupala is a dangerous threat to all of mankind as well his personal power (not in that order). Thus, he's willing to work with any PCs in figuring out a way to banish Kupala back to the Abyss, destroying him outright via &quot;demon diablerie&quot;, binding him again (his least favorite option), or enslaving it as his demonic servant (which he'll keep from the PCs).<br /> <br /> The Salubri Antitribu and Baali are both going to be summoned by Kupala as well for different reasons. The True Black Hand will want to put destroy Kupala outright but they are, for once, way-way way overpowered here. Tzimisce will not be automatically drawn to Kupala but he will appear to the dreams of many to serve them. Kupala will also seek Demons to abandon their service to their Archdemon lords in exchange for Kupala promising he can protect them from their retribution as well as lead them back to Heaven. Most don't fall for this but enough do to form a plurality of demonkind.<br /> <br /> One possible way the Kupala Chronicles will end are:<br /> <br /> 1. The ritual succeeds and Kupala vanishes, possibly now God but....how would you know?<br /> 2. Saulot is summoned back from the Heavens and destroys Kupala as well as himself in the process.<br /> 3. The PCs have the opportunity to sacrifice themselves or at least one of them by bringing Lucifer before Kupala and letting him unleash all of his sunlight upon the region.<br /> 4. Kupala and Belial fight mano-a-mano and destroy each other along with probably eradicating the Masquerade while killing millions.<br /> 5. The &quot;Necronomicon ending&quot; where the PCs discover Kupala's true name and banish him back to the Abyss or unmake him outright.<br /> 6. Like 5# but more dramatic with the majority of Clan Tremere destroyed in the ritual and the PCs having to fight off a last second weakened Tremere as he tries to hijack their bodies to save himself from the result.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-25-2016, 10:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}